  description: 'The finale: one run over the abyss on a road that gets narrower and twistier all the way, through a howling thundersnow storm whose gusts shove you towards the edge - drive off and you fall! Hop the rock pillars, beat the Cliff Lodge''s fast doors and its rolling billiard balls, swipe three tricks out of its panoramic window, four over the void, steer onto a fork of the split landings, hop the platforms, cross the Glass Chalet without stepping on the cracked panes, swipe five tricks, then time three doors, dodge the bowling balls and spin across the disco floor of the Summit Chalet - and make it home!'
